# Purpose
Shows members how to use the Agenda, naming only labels that exist in the
current dashboard.

# Sanitization
Written fresh from the dashboard source (rewrite-only): button labels and
behaviour only; no routes, file names or internal ids.

# Gotchas
- Section order follows the drawer's render order (Questions for you and
  the approvals strip pinned above the headline, headline, Plan your day,
  sprint, projects, My tasks, Org tasks / "Your org", Done today, Snoozed,
  Brain queue (only with items), Schedules); update the table if the
  drawer changes.
- Schedules: Pause/Resume, and Stop repeating needs a second tap within 4 s;
  it deletes the schedule permanently, tasks it already made stay.
- Runs the brain started under a mandate name the brain and the grantor
  ("under <name>'s mandate"), with a Mandate fact on the run.
- Members only: guest workspaces have no Agenda.
- Start does not run anything; Run now with AI sends a normal prompt in the
  user's own console. Plan my day / Plan with AI / Stand-up with AI only
  stage prompts.
- The calendar needs a wider screen (it is off on narrow layouts).
- Complete: "What was done" is required exactly when the Agenda marks it
  (a person's task in a sprint; a draft without a summary; an AI or script
  task without its result card), matching the task list's rule; up to 500
  characters. A draft shows "Approve and complete".
- Action labels as shown on screen (Claim, Start, Complete, Defer, Snooze,
  Run on node, Change assignment); performer choices Human, AI, AI then a
  human (script tasks are created by agents only).

# Change History
- 2026-11-14: Org buttons show names on one scrolling row, node's org first then most recently opened; organisations without an org brain are hidden (owner request).
- 2026-11-14: The Agenda shows one organisation, opens on the selected node's organisation, and has Org buttons to switch (owner request).
- 2026-11-14: Agenda space cards open task, schedule and call details (owner request).
- 2026-11-14: Complete with What was done, Approve and complete, Change assignment, AI fit, Outcome and Completed by facts.
- 2026-11-13: Created (docs turn c345a346).

# 2026-11-24 Agenda reconciliation
Supersedes own-console-only Run now description above. Document Mine/Everyone, ranked Auto one-press Run now, separate Choose node/manual review, changed-task/agreement gates, Run at due explicit confirmation, Run again/Dismiss run and refresh feedback. Read source for actual labels. Do not claim every due task runs or invent permission changes.

# 2026-11-24 Delayed-check distinction draft
Explain that lightweight Brain Talk read-only checks have their own due receipt
and are separate from Agenda tasks/schedules. A saved receipt is not delivery
proof. Keep this addition on the feature branch until matching rollout.
